<p>Hello,</p>
<p>Your video call with xCAI has been successfully scheduled.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>When:</strong> <%= @scheduled_time.in_time_zone(@scheduled.scheduled_tz || Time.zone.name).strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M %Z') %></li>
  <% if @join_url.present? %>
  <li><strong>Your personal video call link:</strong> <a href="<%= @join_url %>" style="background: #4CAF50; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 5px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; margin: 10px 0;">Click here to join your video call</a></li>
  <li style="color: #666; font-size: 14px;">Please save this link - you'll need it to join at the scheduled time</li>
  <% else %>
  <li><strong>Join:</strong> Open your chat window at the scheduled time to join the call.</li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
<p><strong>Important:</strong> Save the link above to join your video call at the scheduled time. You will also receive a reminder 15 minutes before the call starts.</p>
<p>We look forward to speaking with you.</p>
<hr style="border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 20px 0;">
<p style="color: #666; font-size: 12px;">This email was sent by xCAI Support System. If you have any questions, please contact support@support.xcai.io</p>